@startuml
title PayLink - Bill Inquiry and Payment Sequence (FR-6 to FR-15)
autonumber
actor Customer
actor Agent
participant "PayLink API" as API
participant "Payment Service" as PS
participant "Idempotency Store" as Idem
participant "Velocity / Limits" as Rules
participant "Fee Service" as Fees
participant "Wallet / Ledger" as Wallet
participant "Biller Integration" as Adapter
participant "External Biller" as Biller
participant "Payment Event / Audit" as Audit
participant "Notification Service" as Notify

== Bill inquiry ==
Customer -> API: inquire(service, required fields)
API -> Adapter: inquire bill
Adapter -> Biller: bill inquiry (provider protocol)
Biller --> Adapter: bill amount / error
Adapter --> API: normalized bill result
API --> Customer: amount + fee + total OR not found/unavailable
note over Adapter,Biller
ElectroCo: REST/JSON immediate response
AquaCo: SOAP-style XML over HTTP
TopUpNet: REST/JSON; payment result is asynchronous
end note

== Payment ==
Customer -> API: confirm payment(amount, idempotency key)
opt Agent submits on behalf of customer
  Agent -> API: submit payment for customer
end
API -> PS: create payment
PS -> Idem: find key
alt Key already processed
  Idem --> PS: original result
  PS --> API: return original result (no second charge)
  API --> Customer: original payment result
else New key
  PS -> Rules: validate account, velocity,\nsingle and daily limits
  alt Rejected by rule
    Rules --> PS: rejection reason
    PS -> Audit: record rejection/action
    PS --> API: Rejected
    API --> Customer: reason
  else Rules pass
    PS -> Fees: calculate fee using configured rule\n(promotion fee fixed at creation)
    Fees --> PS: fee and total
    PS -> Wallet: hold total amount
    alt Insufficient funds
      Wallet --> PS: hold refused
      PS --> API: Rejected - insufficient funds
      API --> Customer: rejection
    else Hold succeeds
      Wallet --> PS: HOLD ledger entry
      PS -> Audit: record money movement
      PS -> Audit: record FundsHeld PaymentEvent
      PS -> Adapter: submit payment
      Adapter -> Biller: payment request
      PS -> Audit: record SentToBiller event
      alt Immediate biller success
        Biller --> Adapter: paid
        Adapter --> PS: success
        PS -> Wallet: capture hold as CHARGE\nand credit FEE_INCOME
        PS -> Audit: record Completed event and audit entries
        opt Agent-originated payment
          PS -> Wallet: credit agent COMMISSION (40% of fee)
        end
        PS -> Notify: send SMS + push receipt
        PS --> API: Completed
        API --> Customer: receipt
      else Biller refuses
        Biller --> Adapter: refused
        Adapter --> PS: failed + normalized reason
        PS -> Wallet: release hold (HOLD_RELEASE)
        PS -> Audit: record Failed then Refunded events\nand audit entries
        PS -> Notify: send failure SMS
        PS --> API: Failed / funds released
        API --> Customer: failure reason
      else No answer after 10 seconds
        Adapter --> PS: timeout
        PS -> Audit: record Unknown event
        note right of PS
          Funds remain held.
          Re-query after 1, 5 and 15 minutes.
          After 3 unanswered re-queries, keep
          Unknown and wait for callback/reconciliation.
          Never auto-refund Unknown.
        end note
        PS --> API: Unknown - processing
        API --> Customer: payment is being processed
      end
    end
  end
end
@enduml
